  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Pixel Temperature Converter</title>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"card\">\n  <h1>Pixel Temp</h1>\n  <p class=\"sub\">Convert Celsius and Fahrenheit</p>\n\n  <div class=\"field\">\n    <label for=\"temperature\">Temperature</label>\n    <input id=\"temperature\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. 100\" aria-describedby=\"hint\">\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"field\">\n    <label for=\"direction\">Direction</label>\n    <select id=\"direction\">\n      <option value=\"c-to-f\">Celsius to Fahrenheit</option>\n      <option value=\"f-to-c\">Fahrenheit to Celsius</option>\n    </select>\n  </div>\n\n  <button id=\"convert\" type=\"button\">Convert</button>\n\n  <p class=\"hint\" id=\"hint\">C to F: x*9/5+32 &middot; F to C: (x-32)*5/9</p>\n\n  <output id=\"result\" for=\"temperature direction\" aria-live=\"polite\">--</output>\n</main>\n<script src=\"app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
      "description": "Main HTML page with labeled input, direction select, convert button and result output initialized to --."
    },
    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1b1b2f;\n  --panel: #2e2e4a;\n  --accent: #ffcc66;\n  --ink: #f4f4f8;\n  --muted: #9a9ab5;\n}\n\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n[hidden] { display: none !important; }\n\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 24px;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  background-image: linear-gradient(45deg, #23233a 25%, transparent 25%),\n    linear-gradient(-45deg, #23233a 25%, transparent 25%);\n  background-size: 16px 16px;\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--ink);\n}\n\n.card {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 420px;\n  background: var(--panel);\n  padding: 28px;\n  border: 4px solid #000;\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #000;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  margin: 0 0 4px;\n  font-size: 28px;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--accent);\n}\n\n.sub { margin: 0 0 24px; color: var(--muted); }\n\n.field { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 20px; }\n\nlabel { font-weight: 600; }\n\ninput, select, button {\n  font: inherit;\n  padding: 12px;\n  border: 3px solid #000;\n  background: var(--ink);\n  color: #1b1b2f;\n  border-radius: 0;\n}\n\ninput:focus, select:focus, button:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  width: 100%;\n  background: var(--accent);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #000;\n  transition: transform 0.05s, box-shadow 0.05s;\n}\n\nbutton:hover { filter: brightness(1.08); }\nbutton:active { transform: translate(4px, 4px); box-shadow: 0 0 0 #000; }\n\n.hint { color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; margin: 20px 0 16px; }\n\n#result {\n  display: block;\n  text-align: center;\n  font-size: 32px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  padding: 16px;\n  background: #000;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  border: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\n",
      "description": "Pixel-style themed CSS with cohesive palette, pixel borders and shadows, accessible focus/hover/active states, responsive from 360px."
    },
    {
      "path": "app.js",
      "content": "(function () {\n  \"use strict\";\n\n  var input = document.getElementById(\"temperature\");\n  var direction = document.getElementById(\"direction\");\n  var button = document.getElementById(\"convert\");\n  var result = document.getElementById(\"result\");\n\n  function convert() {\n    var raw = input.value.trim();\n    var x = parseFloat(raw);\n\n    if (raw === \"\" || !Number.isFinite(x)) {\n      result.textContent = \"Error\";\n      return;\n    }\n\n    var out;\n    if (direction.value === \"f-to-c\") {\n      out = (x - 32) * 5 / 9;\n    } else {\n      out = x * 9 / 5 + 32;\n    }\n\n    result.textContent = out.toFixed(2);\n  }\n\n  button.addEventListener(\"click\", convert);\n  input.addEventListener(\"keydown\", function (e) {\n    if (e.key === \"Enter\") {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      convert();\n    }\n  });\n})();\n",
      "description": "Plain JS conversion logic with parseFloat/Number.isFinite validation, exact two-decimal output, Error for invalid/empty, wired via addEventListener."
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Temperature Converter\n\nA tiny offline pixel-style temperature converter built with plain HTML, CSS and JavaScript. No packages, no network requests, no storage.\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a temperature in the **Temperature** field.\n3. Choose a **Direction**: Celsius to Fahrenheit or Fahrenheit to Celsius.\n4. Click **Convert** (or press Enter in the input).\n\nThe result shows the numeric value with exactly two decimals and no units. The initial result is `--`.\n\n## Formulas\n\n- Celsius to Fahrenheit: `x * 9 / 5 + 32`\n- Fahrenheit to Celsius: `(x - 32) * 5 / 9`\n\n## Validation\n\nEmpty input, non-numeric text, or non-finite values (NaN, Infinity) produce exactly `Error`.\n\n## Element IDs\n\n| Element | ID |\n| --- | --- |\n| Text input | `temperature` |\n| Direction select (`c-to-f` / `f-to-c`) | `direction` |\n| Convert button | `convert` |\n| Result output | `result` |\n\n## Keyboard Access\n\nAll controls are labeled and focusable. Use Tab to move between controls, arrow keys to change the select, and Enter in the input to convert.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` - markup\n- `styles.css` - pixel theme\n- `app.js` - conversion logic\n\n## Constraints\n\nOffline only. Relative paths. No imports, packages, external assets, iframes or server code.\n",
      "description": "README documenting usage, formulas, element IDs, keyboard access, files and offline constraints."
    }
  ]
